### Editar punto de una ejecución (por locationId) — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/editLocation
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "workPlanExecutionId": 1,
  "locationId": 1,
  "locationName": "Punto A - Actualizado",
  "radius": 150,
  "minTime": 15,
  "maxTime": 45
}

### Editar punto identificado por privateCode con ventana horaria — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/editLocation
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "workPlanExecutionId": 1,
  "privateCode": "REF-EXISTENTE",
  "comments": "Ventana de atención actualizada",
  "minHour": "2026-08-21T09:00:00",
  "maxHour": "2026-08-21T16:00:00"
}

### Sin token → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/editLocation
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workPlanExecutionId": 1,
  "locationId": 1,
  "minTime": 15
}

### Sin workPlanExecutionId (requerido) → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/editLocation
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "locationId": 1,
  "locationName": "Sin ejecución"
}

### Ejecución inexistente → 400/500 según manejo del SP
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/editLocation
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "workPlanExecutionId": 999999999,
  "locationId": 1,
  "minTime": 10
}

### WD-2553 — Reemplazar el conjunto de pedidos de la parada — 200
### La lista reemplaza por completo: las que estaban y no vienen en el payload se
### liberan (si no tienen devoluciones registradas). S00043 no existe y se crea.
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/editLocation
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "workPlanExecutionId": 1,
  "locationId": 1,
  "minTime": 15,
  "maxTime": 45,
  "orders": [
    { "orderId": 1001, "volume": 10 },
    { "orderNumber": "S00043", "volume": 2 }
  ]
}

### WD-2553 — orders vacío quita todos los pedidos de la parada — 200
### Las órdenes sin devoluciones se desvinculan y vuelven a Pendiente en el catálogo;
### VisitaPunto.OrderNumber queda en null y la parada NO se recrea.
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/editLocation
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "workPlanExecutionId": 1,
  "locationId": 1,
  "orders": []
}

### WD-2553 — Sin la clave orders no se tocan los pedidos — 200
### Verificar con getExecutionInformation que los pedidos siguen vinculados.
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/editLocation
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "workPlanExecutionId": 1,
  "locationId": 1,
  "minTime": 20,
  "maxTime": 60
}

### WD-2553 — Pedido ambiguo al editar → 400
### Esperado: message que empieza con "ambiguousOrders:" y la parada sin cambios.
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/editLocation
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "workPlanExecutionId": 1,
  "locationId": 1,
  "orders": [
    { "orderNumber": "S00042", "volume": 1 }
  ]
}
